QUENTIN METEIER is currently pursuing the Ph.D. degree with the University of Fribourg and the HES-SO University of Applied Sciences and Arts Western Switzerland. He is also working on conditionally automated driving. His research interest includes evaluating the physiological state of the driver using machine learning techniques.
EMMANUEL DE SALIS is currently pursuing the Ph.D. degree with the University of Fribourg and the HES-SO University of Applied Sciences and Arts Western Switzerland. He is also working on conditionally automated driving. His research interest includes supporting the driver in takeover situations using machine learning techniques.
